 Set up the Cloudflare tunnel                                                                                     5 / 7
 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

   Tunnel name  › bonsai
     Bonsai creates this tunnel if missing after you confirm in Review. It forwards the receiver (127.0.0.1:7002);
     ingress rules in your own cloudflared config take precedence.

 › Public URL   › http://hooks.example.com
     Bonsai routes this hostname to your tunnel after you confirm in Review. Your domain must be on Cloudflare; sign
     in when prompted.

  ✗ Public URL must be an https:// address with no path, for example https://hooks.example.com.



























